      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "[R8]  CMDS       -> CMD MAIS_CMDS\n[R9]  CMDS       -> CMD_COND CMDS\n[R10] CMDS       -> DC\n[R11] CMDS       -> λ (vazio)\n[R12] MAIS_CMDS  -> ; CMDS\n[R13] CMD_COND   -> if ( CONDICAO ) { CMDS } PFALSA\n[R14] CMD_COND   -> while ( CONDICAO ) { CMDS }\n[R15] CMD        -> System.out.println ( EXPRESSAO )\n[R16] CMD        -> id RESTO_IDENT\n[R17] PFALSA     -> else { CMDS }\n[R18] PFALSA     -> λ (vazio)\n[R19] RESTO_IDENT-> = EXP_IDENT\n[R20] EXP_IDENT  -> EXPRESSAO\n[R21] EXP_IDENT  -> lerDouble()",
