      "text": "Est 72 | ACTION: PONTO_VIRG:r5                                                               | GOTO: ---\nEst 73 | ACTION: DOUBLE:s17, FECHA_CHAVE:r11, ID:s21, IF:s18, PRINT:s20, WHILE:s19           | GOTO: CMD->27, CMDS->82, CMD_COND->26, DC->...\nEst 74 | ACTION: FECHA_PAR:r22                                                               | GOTO: ---\nEst 75 | ACTION: EQ:r37, FECHA_PAR:r37, GE:r37, GT:r37, LE:r37, LT:r37, MAIS:s62, MENOS:s... | GOTO: OP_AD->65, OUTROS_TERMOS->83\nEst 76 | ACTION: FECHA_PAR:s84                                                               | GOTO: ---\nEst 77 | ACTION: ABRE_PAR:r42, ID:r42, NUMERO_REAL:r42                                       | GOTO: ---\nEst 78 | ACTION: ABRE_PAR:r43, ID:r43, NUMERO_REAL:r43                                       | GOTO: ---\nEst 79 | ACTION: EQ:r30, FECHA_PAR:r30, GE:r30, GT:r30, LE:r30, LT:r30, MAIS:r30, MENOS:r... | GOTO: ---\nEst 80 | ACTION: ABRE_PAR:s68, ID:s66, NUMERO_REAL:s67                                       | GOTO: FATOR->85\nEst 81 | ACTION: DOUBLE:s17, FECHA_CHAVE:r11, ID:s21, IF:s18, PRINT:s20, WHILE:s19           | GOTO: CMD->27, CMDS->86, CMD_COND->26, DC->...\nEst 82 | ACTION: FECHA_CHAVE:s87                                                             | GOTO: ---\nEst 83 | ACTION: EQ:r36, FECHA_PAR:r36, GE:r36, GT:r36, LE:r36, LT:r36, NE:r36, PONTO_VIR... | GOTO: ---\nEst 84 | ACTION: DIV:r35, EQ:r35, FECHA_PAR:r35, GE:r35, GT:r35, LE:r35, LT:r35, MAIS:r35... | GOTO: ---\nEst 85 | ACTION: DIV:s78, EQ:r41, FECHA_PAR:r41, GE:r41, GT:r41, LE:r41, LT:r41, MAIS:r41... | GOTO: MAIS_FATORES->88, OP_MUL->80\nEst 86 | ACTION: FECHA_CHAVE:s89                                                             | GOTO: ---\nEst 87 | ACTION: DOUBLE:r18, ELSE:s90, FECHA_CHAVE:r18, ID:r18, IF:r18, PRINT:r18, WHILE:r18 | GOTO: PFALSA->91\nEst 88 | ACTION: EQ:r40, FECHA_PAR:r40, GE:r40, GT:r40, LE:r40, LT:r40, MAIS:r40, MENOS:r... | GOTO: ---\nEst 89 | ACTION: DOUBLE:r14, FECHA_CHAVE:r14, ID:r14, IF:r14, PRINT:r14, WHILE:r14           | GOTO: ---\nEst 90 | ACTION: ABRE_CHAVE:s92                                                              | GOTO: ---\nEst 91 | ACTION: DOUBLE:r13, FECHA_CHAVE:r13, ID:r13, IF:r13, PRINT:r13, WHILE:r13           | GOTO: ---\nEst 92 | ACTION: DOUBLE:s17, FECHA_CHAVE:r11, ID:s21, IF:s18, PRINT:s20, WHILE:s19           | GOTO: CMD->27, CMDS->93, CMD_COND->26, DC->...\nEst 93 | ACTION: FECHA_CHAVE:s94                                                             | GOTO: ---\nEst 94 | ACTION: DOUBLE:r17, FECHA_CHAVE:r17, ID:r17, IF:r17, PRINT:r17, WHILE:r17           | GOTO: ---",
      "fontSize": 9.5,
